/Title (We hardened the design with LibreLane on SkyWater SKY130, inside a 2x2 Tiny Tapeout tile. All 6,067 cells are standard cell logic, and the arithmetic is 72 percent of them. Each flip flop is attributed to the module that owns the register driving it, thus this is how the blocks were located)
